                              "value":  "\u003cdiv class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-cssliststyle=\"none\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-layout=\"default\" data-local-id=\"fb139157-4253-4e9d-8a4a-6fa9775d6bc7\" data-macro-id=\"2a6c5470-3a35-40b4-8c99-5906943175c0\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"\u003e \u003c/div\u003e\u003ch2 local-id=\"814d9563-1dfc-4a51-b1a4-eac281189a38\" id=\"Phase2-Configuration-Easypay-Userstory\"\u003eUser story\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"19ab085794c9\"\u003eAs a system user\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"620021744e23\"\u003eI would like to be able to manage which Easy pay merchant ID and secret key will be used per instance.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 local-id=\"de19c23b-994f-4606-a7e8-053cfa0dbb73\" id=\"Phase2-Configuration-Easypay-Asisprocess\"\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eAs is process\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"f00d44856dc6\"\u003eIn the current process, the whole system uses the XXX Merchant ID and the XXX Secret Key in the Easy pay integration.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 local-id=\"5e0fb36e-6f3a-4600-9a55-378b97abfaca\" id=\"Phase2-Configuration-Easypay-Newprocess\"\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eNew process\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"36a931376985\"\u003eIN the new process, it should be possible for user (with the permission) to configure which Merchant ID and Secret key will be used in in the easy pay integration per instance.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"120098332990\"\u003eThis should be possible from the instance configuration page (please check the story \u003ca href=\"/wiki/spaces/Phoenix/pages/535658502/Configuration+page\" data-linked-resource-id=\"535658502\" data-linked-resource-version=\"24\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\"\u003eConfiguration page\u003c/a\u003e )\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 local-id=\"5593a4f1-dcc4-4be0-a482-c8917d5a1128\" id=\"Phase2-Configuration-Easypay-Acceptancecriteria\"\u003eAcceptance criteria\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch4 local-id=\"5690ae16-fcfc-4a9a-bbe9-17a643728292\" id=\"Phase2-Configuration-Easypay-MerchantID(IDÐ½Ð°ÑÑÑÐ³Ð¾Ð²ÐµÑ)placeholder\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMerchant ID (ID Ð½Ð° ÑÑÑÐ³Ð¾Ð²ÐµÑ)\u003c/strong\u003e placeholder\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"1892b444592a\"\u003eText field with no validations, 1028 characters, mandatory\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"c8eeeb20bd5a\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSecret key (Ð¢Ð°ÐµÐ½ ÐºÐ»ÑÑ) \u003c/strong\u003eplaceholder\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"7aedffbb77a5\"\u003eText field with no validations, 4096 characters, mandatory\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"d8220251b74e\"\u003eÂ \u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 local-id=\"a354627a-3dc7-401f-b596-945c9ea8715e\" id=\"Phase2-Configuration-Easypay-Preconditions\"\u003ePreconditions\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch3 local-id=\"422b4754-e602-42ae-9549-1450876bf018\" id=\"Phase2-Configuration-Easypay-permission\"\u003epermission\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"645cd67006ca\"\u003eThe user should have the permission to change the configuration settings.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 local-id=\"c36efb90-7e34-4405-a0a0-bf0b938a23fc\" id=\"Phase2-Configuration-Easypay-Settheconfiguration\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSet the configuration\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"fd722a371545\"\u003eThe Easy pay settings should be set on system settings\u0026gt;configuration page.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"cc254d99717f\" /\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"table-wrap\"\u003e\u003ctable data-table-width=\"760\" data-layout=\"default\" data-local-id=\"330e1e12-7dd7-4a96-a1f6-4194415062b4\" class=\"confluenceTable\"\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr data-local-id=\"b8cb06f6-b533-4446-b878-59a74224158f\"\u003e\u003cth data-local-id=\"ebc990919d68\" class=\"confluenceTh\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"0710e45699c4\" /\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth data-highlight-colour=\"#f0f1f2\" data-local-id=\"e797a579-220e-4d7b-90c8-5a9d8c2dfd47\" class=\"confluenceTh\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"a2ec56459cfb\" /\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"a953fc5b065d\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ephase 1\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth data-highlight-colour=\"#f0f1f2\" data-local-id=\"93c065ef-998a-44d9-a727-56ca7653a99e\" class=\"confluenceTh\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"43627fcfedc2\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePhase 2\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth data-highlight-colour=\"#f0f1f2\" data-local-id=\"4699e6de-0df0-484d-985c-24df91f879f1\" class=\"confluenceTh\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"15a3b5494d4d\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eObjects that are linked with this change\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth data-highlight-colour=\"#f0f1f2\" data-local-id=\"f7de0d14-a89d-47a7-8e41-02d2f9d5a56f\" class=\"confluenceTh\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"9d679793fba9\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAssociated changes links\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr data-local-id=\"50205e69-a185-4aeb-a1d0-fed5a5a64077\"\u003e\u003ctd data-highlight-colour=\"#ffffff\" data-local-id=\"2b29e1df-2a45-487c-be2a-7db446ace937\" class=\"confluenceTd\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"307c3101d1d8\"\u003eÂ The whole page is newly added\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd data-highlight-colour=\"#ffffff\" data-local-id=\"b6f30e0b-3217-49df-b697-a452294e81ff\" class=\"confluenceTd\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"bdfd97a97459\"\u003eIn phase 1, there was no configuration page, so the Merchant ID and Secret key of the Easy pay were hardcoded in the system.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd data-highlight-colour=\"#ffffff\" data-local-id=\"4c98702f-0cfe-45c8-ba83-981fdff25640\" class=\"confluenceTd\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"70b1594afd30\"\u003eIn Phase 2, the Merchant ID and Secret key of the Easy pay are editable in the configuration.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"4565503d0985\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/wiki/spaces/Phoenix/pages/537690116/Configuration+-+Easy+pay\" data-linked-resource-id=\"537690116\" data-linked-resource-version=\"4\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\"\u003eConfiguration - Easy pay\u003c/a\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd data-highlight-colour=\"#ffffff\" data-local-id=\"b3299577-308a-4529-9669-b10b10c8fb8b\" class=\"confluenceTd\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"fda11d7ba2ff\"\u003eOnline Payment\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd data-highlight-colour=\"#ffffff\" data-local-id=\"eae58a46-b40f-4217-bb7d-3418ed411311\" class=\"confluenceTd\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"cad720ed11d2\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/wiki/spaces/Phoenix/pages/535658502/Configuration+page\" data-linked-resource-id=\"535658502\" data-linked-resource-version=\"24\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\"\u003eConfiguration page\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e",
